.SS "struct  { \&.\&.\&. }  schultz_draw_cmd::fill_path"
Valid when kind is SCHULTZ_DRAW_FILL_PATH\&. Steps and points live in the arena and are valid until it is reset\&. The two arrays are read together: each step takes the points it needs off the front of the second\&. Every step here is CLOSE, MOVE, LINE or CURVE; a quadratic was raised to a cubic on the way in\&. 
